e for trading purposes. You can switch between linked accounts through your online trading portal or by contacting our customer support.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Can I start trading once my account is activated?</span>&nbsp;<svg class="faq-chevron" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></div><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-content">Yes, once your account is activated, you can start trading immediately. You will receive your login credentials via email and SMS. Simply log in to the trading platform, deposit funds into your linked bank account, and you're ready to place your first trade.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">How do I track my application status?</span>&nbsp;<svg class="faq-chevron" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></div><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-content">You can track your application status by logging into the HDFC securities portal and navigating to the "My Applications" section. You will also receive email and SMS notifications at each stage of the application process. If you face any issues, you can contact our support team with your application reference number.</div></div></div></div></div>
