59	api::stock.stock	auzo3jw5o3prwh9h3o9x60xb	\N	published	{"id": 1, "FAQ": null, "Name": "Idealake", "icon": {"id": 1}, "FandO": "<h3 class=\\"overview-card-title\\">F&amp;O&nbsp;<svg class=\\"info-icon\\" viewbox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"2\\"><circle cx=\\"12\\" cy=\\"12\\" r=\\"10\\"></circle><path d=\\"M12 16v-4\\"></path><path d=\\"M12 8h.01\\"></path></svg></h3><p class=\\"fo-description\\">A snapshot on how the stock has performed in the derivatives segment on a real-time basis.</p><p class=\\"fo-stock-name\\">Reliance Industries</p><div class=\\"fo-price-row\\"><span class=\\"fo-price\\">1,566.49</span> <span class=\\"fo-change positive\\">+26.08(1.4%)</span></div><p class=\\"fo-expiry\\">Expiry Month: May 2026</p><div class=\\"fo-range-section\\"><div class=\\"fo-range-row\\"><span class=\\"fo-range-label\\">Today's Low</span> <span class=\\"fo-range-label\\">Today's High</span></div><div class=\\"fo-range-values\\"><span class=\\"fo-range-value low\\">1,531.00</span> <span class=\\"fo-range-value high\\">1,541.00</span></div><div class=\\"fo-range-bar\\"><div class=\\"fo-range-indicator\\" style=\\"left:65%;\\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class=\\"fo-stats-grid\\"><div class=\\"fo-stat-item\\"><div class=\\"fo-stat-label\\">Open</div><div class=\\"fo-stat-value\\">1,141.00</div></div><div class=\\"fo-stat-item\\"><div class=\\"fo-stat-label\\">Prev. Close</div><div class=\\"fo-stat-value\\">1,141.00</div></div><div class=\\"fo-stat-item\\"><div class=\\"fo-stat-label\\">Volume</div><div class=\\"fo-stat-value\\">10,10,679</div></div><div class=\\"fo-stat-item\\"><div class=\\"fo-stat-label\\">OI</div><div class=\\"fo-stat-value\\">9,83,84,500</div></div><div class=\\"fo-stat-item\\"><div class=\\"fo-stat-label\\">OI Change (%)</div><div class=\\"fo-stat-value\\">1.82</div></div></div>", "locale": null, "reports": [{"locale": null, "documentId": "oazjsl3dnksj3zt352zvxqi5", "publishedAt": null}, {"locale": null, "documentId": "zinh8eur08getfqpnyg9lkn4", "publishedAt": null}, {"locale": null, "documentId": "cik4imjogkone1wppgohykej", "publishedAt": null}], "subTitle": "India's Tech Company", "documentId": "auzo3jw5o3prwh9h3o9x60xb", "stock_tags": [], "StockAdvice": "<h3 class=\\"overview-card-title\\">Stock Advice</h3><p class=\\"advice-question\\">Is this Stock good for you?</p><p class=\\"advice-answer\\">Yes, the Stock is good when investing for a long period</p><p class=\\"advice-suited-title\\">Who is best suited for this stock</p><ul class=\\"advice-list\\"><li data-list-item-id=\\"e73eb356584642bf35c7fb405120e365c\\">First-time investors</li><li data-list-item-id=\\"e06610048d407d4f81be4850f535722f8\\">SIP / monthly investing</li><li data-list-item-id=\\"e06726266531c7420efad17297daa3c95\\">5+ year goals</li></ul>", "description": "If you mean Idealake Information Technologies Pvt. Ltd., it is not a publicly listed stock. I found that Idealake is a private limited company, with FY2025 revenue reported at about ₹26.5 crore.", "RiskOverview": "<h3 class=\\"overview-card-title\\">Risk Overview</h3><p class=\\"risk-description\\">Reliance Industry pvt ltd is large diversified company which lowers the risk and stabilizes your returns in the long run.</p><div class=\\"risk-levels\\"><span class=\\"risk-level-label\\">Risk Level</span> <span class=\\"risk-level-label\\">Risk Level</span></div><div class=\\"risk-bar-container\\"><p><span class=\\"risk-label\\">Low</span></p><div class=\\"risk-bar\\"><div class=\\"risk-indicator\\" style=\\"left:35%;\\">&nbsp;</div></div><p><span class=\\"risk-label\\">High</span></p></div>", "CompanyDetails": null, "CompanyOverview": "<div class=\\"container\\"><h2 class=\\"company-title\\">Company <span>Overview</span></h2><div class=\\"company-top-grid\\"><div class=\\"company-desc-card\\"><h3 class=\\"company-desc-title\\">Market Depth</h3><p class=\\"company-desc-text\\">Reliance Industries Limited is a Fortune Global 500 company and the largest private sector company in India. The company's growth mirrors the relentless spirit of dynamism and hope that defines the nation, with its core motto being 'Growth is Life'. Its mission is to be the most admired, innovative, and value-generating organisation for all its stakeholders, operating through growth engines</p><p><a class=\\"company-read-more\\" href=\\"#\\">Read More</a></p></div><div class=\\"company-news-card\\"><h3 class=\\"company-news-title\\">News</h3><div class=\\"company-news-list\\"><div class=\\"company-news-item\\"><p class=\\"company-news-headline\\">Reliance Resumes Russian Oil Imports via Compliant Routes, Maintains Jamnagar Refinery Operations</p><p><span class=\\"company-news-date\\">2 days ago</span></p></div><div class=\\"company-news-item\\"><p class=\\"company-news-headline\\">Reliance Resumes Russian Oil Imports via Compliant Routes</p><p><span class=\\"company-news-date\\">2 days ago</span></p></div><div class=\\"company-news-item\\"><p class=\\"company-news-headline\\">Reliance Resumes Russian Oil Imports via Compliant Routes, Maintains Jamnagar</p><p><span class=\\"company-news-date\\">4 days ago</span></p></div><div class=\\"company-news-item\\"><p class=\\"company-news-headline\\">Reliance Resumes Russian Oil Imports via Compliant Routes, Maintains Jamnagar Refinery Operations</p><p><span class=\\"company-news-date\\">6 days ago</span></p></div></div><p><a class=\\"company-view-more\\" href=\\"#\\">View More</a></p></div></div><div class=\\"company-details-header\\"><h3 class=\\"company-details-title\\">Company Details</h3><p class=\\"company-details-subtitle\\">Check out the key parameters of the company to understand the financial health and stock performance</p></div><div class=\\"company-tabs\\"><button class=\\"company-tab active\\" data-tab=\\"tech-analysis\\">Technical Analysis</button> <button class=\\"company-tab\\" data-tab=\\"profit-loss\\">Profit &amp; Loss</button> <button class=\\"company-tab\\" data-tab=\\"balance-sheet\\">Balance Sheet</button> <button class=\\"company-tab\\" data-tab=\\"dividend-history\\">Dividend History</button> <button class=\\"company-tab\\" data-tab=\\"comparative-return\\">Comparative Return</button></div><div class=\\"company-tab-content active\\" id=\\"tech-analysis\\"><p class=\\"tech-description\\">Understand price trends and important levels where the stock usually faces buying or selling pressure. Helpful for timing your entry or exit.</p><p class=\\"tech-section-title\\">Key Definitions</p><p class=\\"tech-definition\\"><strong>Key levels :</strong> price points where the stock usually slows down, changes direction, or attracts strong buying or selling.</p><p class=\\"tech-definition\\"><strong>Resistance :</strong> Resistance is a price level where selling pressure increases and the stock may stop rising temporarily.</p><p class=\\"tech-definition\\"><strong>Support :</strong> Support is a price level where buying interest is strong and the stock may stop falling.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"tech-section-title\\">How to read technical Analysis</p><p class=\\"tech-how-to\\"><strong>Under Key Level heading:</strong> These levels are based on past price behavior and help identify possible buy or sell zones.</p><p class=\\"tech-how-to\\"><strong>Under Resistance 1 / Resistance 2 :</strong> Higher resistance means stronger selling pressure.</p><p class=\\"tech-how-to\\"><strong>Under Support 1 / Support 2 :</strong> Lower support means stronger buying interest.</p><div class=\\"tech-stats-bar\\"><div class=\\"tech-stat-item\\"><span class=\\"tech-stat-label\\">Open</span> <span class=\\"tech-stat-value open\\">1430.10</span></div><div class=\\"tech-stat-item\\"><span class=\\"tech-stat-label\\">High</span> <span class=\\"tech-stat-value high\\">1561.10</span></div><div class=\\"tech-stat-item\\"><span class=\\"tech-stat-label\\">Low</span> <span class=\\"tech-stat-value low\\">1461.10</span></div><div class=\\"tech-stat-item\\"><span