-description\\">Understand price trends and important levels where the stock usually faces buying or selling pressure. Helpful for timing your entry or exit.</p><p class=\\"tech-section-title\\">Key Definitions</p><p class=\\"tech-definition\\"><strong>Key levels :</strong> price points where the stock usually slows down, changes direction, or attracts strong buying or selling.</p><p class=\\"tech-definition\\"><strong>Resistance :</strong> Resistance is a price level where selling pressure increases and the stock may stop rising temporarily.</p><p class=\\"tech-definition\\"><strong>Support :</strong> Support is a price level where buying interest is strong and the stock may stop falling.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"tech-section-title\\">How to read technical Analysis</p><p class=\\"tech-how-to\\"><strong>Under Key Level heading:</strong> These levels are based on past price behavior and help identify possible buy or sell zones.</p><p class=\\"tech-how-to\\"><strong>Under Resistance 1 / Resistance 2 :</strong> Higher resistance means stronger selling pressure.</p><p class=\\"tech-how-to\\"><strong>Under Support 1 / Support 2 :</strong> Lower support means stronger buying interest.</p><div class=\\"tech-stats-bar\\"><div class=\\"tech-stat-item\\"><span class=\\"tech-stat-label\\">Open</span> <span class=\\"tech-stat-value open\\">1430.10</span></div><div class=\\"tech-stat-item\\"><span class=\\"tech-stat-label\\">High</span> <span class=\\"tech-stat-value high\\">1561.10</span></div><div class=\\"tech-stat-item\\"><span class=\\"tech-stat-label\\">Low</span> <span class=\\"tech-stat-value low\\">1461.10</span></div><div class=\\"tech-stat-item\\"><span class=\\"tech-stat-label\\">Volume</span> <span class=\\"tech-stat-value volume\\">23,11,345</span></div></div><div class=\\"tech-chart-container\\"><canvas id=\\"techChart\\"></canvas></div><figure class=\\"table\\"><table class=\\"tech-data-table\\"><thead><tr><th>Key Average</th><th>Resistance 1</th><th>Resistance 2</th><th>Support 1</th><th>Support 2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\\"label\\">Key Average</td><td>1550</td><td>1525</td><td>1400</td><td>1300</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\\"table\\"><table class=\\"tech-data-table\\"><thead><tr><th>Moving Average</th><th>20 days</th><th>50 days</th><th>100 days</th><th>200 days</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\\"label\\">Moving Average</td><td>1453.93</td><td>1453.93</td><td>1453.93</td><td>1453.93</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div><div class=\\"company-tab-content\\" id=\\"profit-loss\\"><p class=\\"tech-description\\">Profit &amp; Loss statement details will be displayed here.</p></div><div class=\\"company-tab-content\\" id=\\"balance-sheet\\"><p class=\\"tech-description\\">Balance Sheet details will be displayed here.</p></div><div class=\\"company-tab-content\\" id=\\"dividend-history\\"><p class=\\"tech-description\\">Dividend History details will be displayed here.</p></div><div class=\\"company-tab-content\\" id=\\"comparative-return\\"><p class=\\"tech-description\\">Comparative Return details will be displayed here.</p></div>", "CompanyOverview": "<div class=\\"container\\"><h2 class=\\"company-title\\">Company <span>Overview</span></h2><div class=\\"company-top-grid\\"><div class=\\"company-desc-card\\"><h3 class=\\"company-desc-title\\">Market Depth</h3><p class=\\"company-desc-text\\">Reliance Industries Limited is a Fortune Global 500 company and the largest private sector company in India. The company's growth mirrors the relentless spirit of dynamism and hope that defines the nation, with its core motto being 'Growth is Life'. Its mission is to be the most admired, innovative, and value-generating organisation for all its stakeholders, operating through growth engines</p><p><a class=\\"company-read-more\\" href=\\"#\\">Read More</a></p></div><div class=\\"company-news-card\\"><h3 class=\\"company-news-title\\">News</h3><div class=\\"company-news-list\\"><div class=\\"c